  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-28T20:41:57.470Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please remove this \"feature\", at least with full body tracking. It happens so often that I'm lying down on a sofa or something, but since the back of my head is slightly touching the edge of the sofa collider my entire avatar is frozen in place until my head comes out of it again.\nThis also happens a lot when trying to grab objects off tables etc. Your hand just gets stuck for no reason. Clipping is ok! It's fine!\nI get why it exists, but you could easily let the visual part of the avatar still clip through walls while still having the player collider unable to walk through them.",
